### Project Structure

```
forensics-platform/
├── src/forensics_platform/     # Source code
│   ├── core/                   # Core system
│   ├── utils/                  # Utilities
│   ├── database/               # Database layer
│   ├── audit/                  # Audit system
│   ├── gui/                    # GUI (Phase 2)
│   ├── forensics/              # Forensics engine
│   ├── carving/                # File carving
│   ├── sanitization/           # Sanitization
│   └── reporting/              # Reports
├── tests/                      # Test suite
├── data/                       # Configuration data
├── docs/                       # Documentation
└── scripts/                    # Utility scripts
```

